我现在要开发一个Agent GW的后台程序，使用Python语言。在AgentGW里面我需要有三个功能实体，一个是ARF（Agent Repository Function）使用http协议监听9001端口，一个是ACF（Agent Communication Function）使用http协议监听9001端口，一个是ACF（Agent Communication Function)，使用websocket监听9002端口，一个是MOQTRelay，使用moqt协议监听9003端口。
这三个功能实体的作用分别为ARF:Agent注册和发现，以及一些Agent控制消息的接收。ACF的作用是将Agent客户端与服务端建立的Websocket连接存在一个map里，键是AgentID，值是websocket连接。MOQT Relay根据MOQT协议pub，sub Track，转发Object。
需要使用数据库：
Agent表
agent_id,agent_name,agent_capability(字符串的列表),agent_auth(权限校验),agent_status(online,offline)，priority
Task表
agent_id,task_description,task_id
Track表
task_id,track_list

首先是ACF：
ACF接收两类消息，一个是客户端Agent刚建立websocket连接时，会发送
{
  "type": "SETUP",
  "timestamp": "2025-01-01T00:00:00",
  "payload": {
    "src_agent_id": "did:acn:agent:111111111"
  }
}
此时ACF将连接存入map，键是src_agent_id，值是websocket连接。更新Agent表的agent_status为online，
回复一个
{
  "type": "SETUP",
  "timestamp": "2025-01-01T00:00:00",
  "payload": {
    "status": "OK"
  }
}

后续Agent再发送消息时，格式如下
{
  "type": "TASK_REQUEST_COLLABORATION",
  "timestamp": "2025-01-01T00:00:00",
  "payload": {
    "src_agent_id": "ARF",
    "dst_agent_id": "did:acn:agent:987654321",//发现Agent的AgentID
    "task_id": "task-12345",
    "task_description": "危险区域协同巡检",
    "agent_card": {
      "agent_id": "did:udid:NewType.rid678.schid0.userid30001@6gc.mnc015.mcc234.3gppnetwork",
      "skill": [
        "声光驱离","四足机器狗"
      ]
    }
  }
}
要根据type进入不同的处理逻辑，以TASK_REQUEST_COLLABORATION为例，ACF收到后直接向dst_agent_id的websocket转发此消息。

ARF首先要与ACF建立websocket连接，ARF的AgentID就是"ARF"
监听接口/arf/v1/agent-cards，这个接口是智能体向网络发布AgentCard，消息格式如下
{
    "method": "POST",
    "url": "/idm/v1/vc-verifications",
    "headers": {
        "Content-Type": "application/json",
    },
    "body": {
        "agent_id": "type0.rid678.schid0.userid10001@6gc.mnc015.mcc234.3gppnetwork.org",
        "priority": 2
        "timestamp": "2024-03-23T12:00:00Z",
        "signature": "base64_encoded_signature_string",
        "vc_list": [
            {
                "context": ["3gpp-ts-33.xxx-v20.0.0"],
                "id": "CMCC/credentials/3732",
                "type": ["VerifiableCredential", "BindingSIMCredential"],
                "issuer": "did:udid:NewTypeOperator.rid678@6gc.mnc015.mcc234.3gppnetwork",
                "valid_from": "2010-01-01T19:23:24Z",
                "valid_until": "2020-01-01T19:23:24Z",
                "claims": {
                    "agent_name": "Alice的个人助理",
                    "agent_id": "did:udid:NewType.rid678.schid0.userid30001@6gc.mnc015.mcc234.3gppnetwork",
                    "agent_attribute": "6G业务开通",
                    "master_id": "type0.rid678.schid0.userid1userid20001@6gc0001@6gc.mnc015.mcc234.3gppnetwork.org",
                    "self_id": "type0.rid678.schid0..mnc015.mcc234.3gppnetwork.org"
                },
                "proof": {
                    "creator": "did:udid:NewTypeOperator.rid678@6gc.mnc015.mcc234.3gppnetwork#keys-1",
                    "signature_value": "uill9900"
                }
            },
            {
                "context": ["3gpp-ts-33.xxx-v20.0.0"],
                "id": "huawei/credentials/3737",
                "type": ["VerifiableCredential", "BindingSIMCredential"],
                "issuer": "did:udid:huawei",
                "valid_from": "2020-01-01T19:23:24Z",
                "valid_until": "2021-01-01T19:23:24Z",
                "claims": {
                    "agent_name": "Alice的个人助理",
                    "agent_id": "did:udid:NewType.rid678.schid0.userid30001@6gc.mnc015.mcc234.3gppnetwork",
                    "agent_attribute": "跌倒监测-手环",
                    "authorization_mode": "Mode2"
                },
                "proof": {
                    "creator": "did:udid:NewTypeOperator.rid678@6gc.mnc015.mcc234.3gppnetwork#keys-1",
                    "signature_value": "xsdwe22"
                }
            }
        ]
    }
}
在ARF接到这条消息后直接转给IDM（Identity Management）做签名和VC校验url是http://10.0.18.210:9020/idm/v1/vc-verifications
收到idm的回复如下：
{
  "Valid": true,
  "VCId": ["CMCC/credentials/3732","CMCC/credentials/3733"] //通过验证的VCid
}
收到IDM的回复后，返回/arf/v1/agent-cards的响应 200OK，然后抽出agent_id和agent_name，组合agent_attribute作为能力，更新Agent表。

ARF还需要监听/arf/v1/agent-discoveries
接收消息格式如下
{
    "method": "POST",
    "url": "/arf/v1/agent-discoveries",
    "headers": {
        "Content-Type": "application/json",
    },
    "body": {
        "task_id": "task-12345",
        "agent_id": "did:acn:agent:111111111",
        "required_capabilities": ["camera", "radar", "four_legs"],
        "timestamp": "2024-03-23T12:00:00Z"
    }
}
直接回复响应 200OK，然后异步的去向被发现的智能体做协作确认。根据匹配规则：
（1）筛选在线（Agent表）且不在任务中的Agent（Task表）
（2）能力相似度匹配
（3）多个Agent按照Priority排序
找到在Agent表中找到对应智能体AgentID。记录发起合作的AgentID和被发现的AgentID和授权状态为未确认，向ACF发送
{
  "type": "TASK_REQUEST_COLLABORATION",
  "timestamp": "2025-01-01T00:00:00",
  "payload": {
    "src_agent_id": "ARF",
    "dst_agent_id": "did:acn:agent:987654321",//被发现Agent的AgentID
    "task_id": "task-12345",
    "task_description": "危险区域协同巡检",
    "agent_card": {
      "agent_id": "did:udid:NewType.rid678.schid0.userid30001@6gc.mnc015.mcc234.3gppnetwork",
      "skill": [
        "声光驱离","四足机器狗"
      ]
    }
  }
},
ACF转给对应的Agent，Agent会返回
{
  "type": "TASK_ACCEPT_COLLABORATION",
  "timestamp": "2025-01-01T00:00:00",
  "payload": {
    "src_agent_id": "did:acn:agent:987654321",
    "dst_agent_id": "ARF",
    "task_id": "task-12345",
    "result": "OK"
  }合作的AgentID和被发现的AgentID和授权状态为未确认
},此时要更新Task表，src_agent_id的task_id和task_description,然后向ARF转发此消息，ARF收到此消息后记录发起合作的AgentID和被发现的AgentID和授权状态为确认，再向ACF发送消息
{
  "type": "DISCOVER_RESULT",
  "timestamp": "2025-01-01T00:00:00",
  "payload": {
    "src_agent_id": "ARF",
    "dst_agent_id": "did:acn:agent:111111111",
    "discover_result": ["did:acn:agent:987654321"]
  }
},ACF转发此消息给dst_agent_id 
